  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity CYED - FLC Trust Fund Contribution is a component of The EdTech Hub (Educational Technology Hub) - Robust research and innovation on digital, data and technology in education systems, providing global public research goods and direct country support for effective decision making on edtech. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,142,229. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Educational research, Education facilities and training.</narrative>
  </description>
